pan style=\"color: rgba(255, 168, 82, 1.0); font-weight: bold;\">56<sup>th</sup></span> percentile word). In general, this word is negatively associated with university ranking, such that higher-ranked institutions are less likely to publish papers containing <span  \"><i>\"zhao\" </i></span> (<span style=\"color: rgba(170, 117, 250, 1.0); font-weight: bold;\">9<sup>th</sup></span> percentile). "}